<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-UNKNOWN MARKSMAN SHOOTS REFEREE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-UNKNOWN MARKSMAN SHOOTS REFEREE.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish police are looking for somebody who shot a referee in the arm during a regional league game.</p>
<p>Jose Miguel del Rio had a pellet removed after being hit while booking a player in Sunday's match between Santa Cruz and Lovio, at which there were only 50 spectators.</p>
<p>&quot;The ground is next to a forest, and I'm sure the shot came from there ... I don't believe it was an accident,&quot; said del Rio.</p>
</text>
